This repository provides companion code for our article, "Historical Control
Data Borrowing Using Bayesian Evidence Synthesis Tactics With Error Rates 
Control". The analyses from the paper can be replicated by opening the file
"BestWerc_repo.Rproj", which will start RStudio in the appropriate working
directory. Then use the script "master.R" to run the subcomponents of the 
analysis one at a time. The results will appear automatically in the results, 
figures, and tables folders. 

The simulation comparison scripts may be very slow (2-3 hours). To run 
smaller and faster versions of the simulation studies, edit the files 
"scripts/sims_normal.R" and "scripts/sims_binary.R" and lower the "nreps"
parameter. 